{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In VariDungeon, you are a hero exploring a dungeon. It may sound classic, but each run is different because its structure changes every time you start again ! Power-ups, enemies, bosses, traps, ... You need to adapt to all these elements in order to defeat the final boss and save the King !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous pixel-art graphics in the style of Game Boy </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 playable classes </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >69 enemies and traps that get stronger as you so </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 power-ups to combine in order to win each fight </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 bosses trying to kill you </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more than 250 rooms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More environments, enemies, power-ups, playable characters and bosses to come in themed updates !</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I've got the Power !!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2160560/60c8770c738ecd9b724e2cf807dcea16b992d6d3.jpg"},{"name":"Triple chance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2160560/b130dc2f89d91106c01cde6d4992f8025182c6af.jpg"},{"name":"Downward","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2160560/eec76a00fd86078b606cd54d720c704a2fb31a9a.jpg"},{"name":"The end is near","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2160560/0603e8831138c3cf78f5c22e220c8a8f4a8e03fa.jpg"},{"name":"The KeyMaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2160560/daba355883227081cbc3f72dc83861fba7a6b3b9.jpg"},{"name":"New Final Final","path":"https://cdn.